  "cited_article_id": "configure-online-appointment-booking",
  "reply": "1. Go to Settings > Patient Portal > Booking Rules and turn on Allow Online Appointment Booking. 2. In Scheduling > Visit Types, open each visit type you want patients to book and check the Available Online box – leave all other visit types unchecked. 3. In Settings > Schedule > Provider Availability, select only the providers who should accept online requests. Providers not selected will not appear for patients. Ensure the chosen providers have published schedules and active rooms."
}
